\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Your humility score is the strongest feature of the profile. Used well, it enables you to revise assumptions, share status, admit uncertainty, and invite expertise.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How it offsets risk:
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 Humility can interrupt ethical certainty and strategic overconfidence. It makes it easier to say, \'93I may be reading the politics correctly, but what evidence would show that I am wrong?\'94\

