\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Your ethical leadership score suggests a strong internal commitment to responsible conduct. This gives you a foundation for converting private values into visible standards.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How it offsets risk:
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 Ethical criteria can constrain tactical behaviour. Instead of asking only whether a strategy will work, you can ask whether it is transparent, proportionate, reversible, and defensible to those affected.\

